# The font service (font), asked by fonts, typed at the shell: its faces,
# and the twelve strikes the build made, which it keeps as it starts, in
# 80 of its first arena's 128 pages, and counts as none it built; then
# Source Sans 3 at 24 asked twice by one process, built once, and let go
# once that process exited; then Source Sans 3 at 100, which it must
# make, and Source Code Pro at 16, asked at once, the second answered
# first, while the first is made; a face it has not; and the stats again,
# the strike at 100 let go too.
start /bin/sh
start /sbin/uart noecho
start /sbin/font
dev /sbin/uart
